// Project 4: Microsoft Sentinel SIEM Investigation & Detection
// Query 03: Device Investigation
//
// Purpose:
// Compare device information associated with the suspicious
// authentication against the affected user's recent sign-in activity.
//
// Investigative Question:
// Did the suspicious authentication originate from a device normally
// associated with M. Lopez?
//
// Training Note:
// This project uses synthetic telemetry in a Microsoft Sentinel-style
// environment for cybersecurity portfolio and training purposes.

SigninLogs
| where UserPrincipalName == "mlopez@northstarfinancial.com"
| project
    TimeGenerated,
    IPAddress,
    Location,
    DeviceDetail,
    ResultType
| order by TimeGenerated desc
